<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold"><a href="https://github.com/debenedoro19-dotcom/Tesla-Energy" node="[object Object]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://github.com/debenedoro19-dotcom/Tesla-Energy</a></strong></p>
