resh_&amp;]:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus-visible:ring-fg-accent transition-colors duration-100 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none text-fg-secondary hover:text-fg-primary hover:bg-button-ghost-hover disabled:hover:text-fg-secondary disabled:hover:bg-transparent [&amp;_svg]:hover:text-fg-primary h-8 w-8 rounded-full" type="button" aria-label="Save table" data-state="closed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="stroke-[2] size-4"><path d="M4.16667 13.3333C4.16667 13.9304 4.16693 14.3282 4.1919 14.6338C4.21604 14.9293 4.25893 15.0648 4.30257 15.1506C4.42242 15.3858 4.61425 15.5776 4.84945 15.6974C4.93524 15.7411 5.07075 15.784 5.36621 15.8081C5.6718 15.8331 6.06956 15.8333 6.66667 15.8333H13.3333C13.9304 15.8333 14.3282 15.8331 14.6338 15.8081C14.9293 15.784 15.0648 15.7411 15.1506 15.6974C15.3858 15.5776 15.5776 15.3858 15.6974 15.1506C15.7411 15.0648 15.784 14.9293 15.8081 14.6338C15.8331 14.3282 15.8333 13.9304 15.8333 13.3333V11.6667H17.5V13.3333C17.5 13.903 17.5009 14.3805 17.4691 14.7697C17.4365 15.1686 17.3652 15.5476 17.1818 15.9074C16.9022 16.4562 16.4562 16.9022 15.9074 17.1818C15.5476 17.3651 15.1686 17.4365 14.7697 17.4691C14.3805 17.5009 13.903 17.5 13.3333 17.5H6.66667C6.09703 17.5 5.61951 17.5009 5.23031 17.4691C4.83143 17.4365 4.45245 17.3651 4.09261 17.1818C3.54385 16.9022 3.09782 16.4562 2.8182 15.9074C2.63485 15.5476 2.56353 15.1686 2.53093 14.7697C2.49913 14.3805 2.5 13.903 2.5 13.3333V11.6667H4.16667V13.3333Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M10.8333 10.2799L13.5775 7.53581L14.7559 8.71419L10 13.4701L5.24414 8.71419L6.42253 7.53581L9.16667 10.2799V2.5H10.8333V10.2799Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">This is a <strong class="font-semibold">high-fidelity marketing + admin demo</strong>, not a production multi-user system.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Code quality assessment</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Positives</strong></p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Clean TypeScript types for all entities.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Consistent dark Tesla-style UI (colors, cards, red accents).</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Full CRUD admin for many entities (inventory, appointments, testimonials, investments, payments, portfolio, giveaways, orders, users, chat, settings).</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Seed data is rich and realistic-looking.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Responsive layout and reasonable component structure for a solo project.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Disclaimer exists in the footer: <em>“This is a high-fidelity design recreation for demonstration purposes. Not affiliated with Tesla, Inc. or Elon Musk.”</em></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Serious weaknesses</strong></p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Security is essentially non-existent for any real use</strong><ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">User passwords stored in plaintext in localStorage.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Admin password also effectively client-side.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">No rate limiting, no CSRF protection, no server validation.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Anyone who opens DevTools can read/modify all “users”, orders, appointments, chat, etc.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Admin routes have zero real protection (just a sessionStorage flag).</li>
</ul></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Supabase is marketing, not implemented</strong><ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Import exists, flag is shown in admin, SQL schema is provided, but zero actual CRUD calls go through Supabase. The hybrid claim in the README is currently false.</li>
</ul></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Monolithic client components</strong><ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Homepage is one huge <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">"use client"</span> file. Hard to maintain, test, or split.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Duplicate root-level <button class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono cursor-pointer bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300" type="button">page.tsx</button> / <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">layout.tsx</span> / <button class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono cursor-pointer bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300" type="button">globals.css</button> outside <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">src/</span> (leftover clutter).</li>
</ul></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Build config is permissive</strong><div dir="auto" class="not-prose"><div class="relative not-prose @container/code-block [&amp;_div+div]:!mt-0 mb-3 mt-3 @md:-mx-4 @md:-mr-4" data-testid="code-block"><div class="border border-warm-gray-100 dark:border-neutral-900 rounded-xl"><div class="group/code-header flex flex-row px-4 py-2 h-10 items-center rounded-t-xl sticky top-0 z-10 bg-black [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:pr-1 [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:border-b [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:border-warm-gray-100 dark:[.wd-refresh_&amp;]:bg-surface-inset dark:[.wd-refresh_&amp;]:border-neutral-900"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-secondary select-none">TypeScript</span><div class="ml-auto flex flex-row gap-0.5 print:hidden [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:gap-0"><div class="flex flex-row gap-0.5 [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:gap-0" style="opacity: 1;"></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus-visible:ring-fg-accent transition-colors duration-100 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none text-fg-secondary hover:text-fg-primary disabled:hover:text-fg-secondary hover:bg-surface-l2 disabled:hover:bg-surface-l1 h-8 rounded-xl px-3 text-xs bg-transparent" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><div style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"><div class="[&amp;&gt;svg_*]:stroke-current" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px); content-visibility: visible;"><defs><clippath id="__lottie_element_126"><rect width="24" height="24" x="0" y="0"></rect></clippath><g id="__lottie_element_133"><g style="display: block;" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,9.998000144958496,14)" opacity="1"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path fill="rgb(217,217,217)" fill-opacity="1" d=" M9,-5 C9,-5 9,5 9,5 C9,7.207600116729736 7.207600116729736,9 5,9 C5,9 -5,9 -5,9 C-7.207600116729736,9 -9,7.207600116729736 -9,5 C-9,5 -9,-5 -9,-5 C-9,-7.207600116729736 -7.207600116729736,-9 -5,-9 C-5,-9 5,-9 5,-9 C7.207600116729736,-9 9,-7.207600116729736 9,-5z"></path></g></g></g><filter id="__lottie_element_139" filterUnits="objectBoundingBox" x="0%" y="0%" width="100%" height="100%"><fecomponenttransfer in="SourceGraphic"><fefunca type="table" tableValues="1.0 0.0"></fefunca></fecomponenttransfer></filter><mask id="__lottie_element_133_2" mask-type="alpha"><g filter="url(#__lottie_element_139)"><rect width="24" height="24" x="0" y="0" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0"></rect><use href="#__lottie_element_133"></use></g></mask></defs><g clip-path="url(#__lottie_element_126)"><g mask="url(#__lottie_element_133_2)" style="display: block;"><g transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,14.498000144958496,9.5)" opacity="1"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4" stroke="rgb(0,0,0)" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="2" d=" M6.5,-3.5 C6.5,-5.155700206756592 5.155700206756592,-6.5 3.5,-6.5 C3.5,-6.5 -3.5,-6.5 -3.5,-6.5 C-5.155700206756592,-6.5 -6.5,-5.155700206756592 -6.5,-3.5 C-6.5,-3.5 -6.5,3.5 -6.5,3.5 C-6.5,5.155700206756592 -5.155700206756592,6.5 -3.5,6.5 C-3.5,6.5 3.5,6.5 3.5,6.5 C5.155700206756592,6.5 6.5,5.155700206756592 6.5,3.5 C6.5,3.5 6.5,-3.5 6.5,-3.5z"></path></g></g></g><g style="display: block;" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,9.498000144958496,14.5)" opacity="1"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4" stroke="rgb(0,0,0)" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="2" d=" M6.5,-3.5 C6.5,-5.155700206756592 5.155700206756592,-6.5 3.5,-6.5 C3.5,-6.5 -3.5,-6.5 -3.5,-6.5 C-5.155700206756592,-6.5 -6.5,-5.155700206756592 -6.5,-3.5 C-6.5,-3.5 -6.5,3.5 -6.5,3.5 C-6.5,5.155700206756592 -5.155700206756592,6.5 -3.5,6.5 C-3.5,6.5 3.5,6.5 3.5,6.5 C5.155700206756592,6.5 6.5,5.155700206756592 6.5,3.5 C6.5,3.5 6.5,-3.5 6.5,-3.5z"></path></g></g><g style="display: block;" transform="matrix(0.7071067690849304,-0.7071067690849304,0.7071067690849304,0.7071067690849304,9.319999694824219,14.678000450134277)" opacity="1"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4" stroke="rgb(0,0,0)" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="2" d="M0 0"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div><span class="hidden @sm/code-block:block">Copy</span></button></div></div><div class="shiki not-prose relative [&amp;_pre]:overflow-auto [&amp;_pre]:rounded-b-lg [&amp;_pre]:px-4 [&amp;_pre]:py-4 !p-0 [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:[&amp;_pre]:!pt-4" style="border-radius: 0px 0px 12px 12px; border-top-color: currentcolor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: medium; border-right-color: ; border-right-style: ; border-right-width: ; border-bottom-color: ; border-bottom-style: ; border-bottom-width: ; border-left-color: ; border-left-style: ; border-left-width: ; border-image-source: ; border-image-slice: ; border-image-width: ; border-image-outset: ; border-image-repeat: ; padding: 0px 16px 16px; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 0.9em; font-family: var(--font-ibm-plex-mono); line-height: 1.5em; background-color: hsl(var(--surface-inset)); color: var(--fg-primary); display: block; overflow: auto;"><pre class="shiki slack-dark" tabindex="0" style="background-color: rgb(34, 34, 34); color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"><code><span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">typescript: { ignoreBuildErrors: </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">true</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">eslint: { ignoreDuringBuilds: </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">true</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> },</span></span></code></pre></div><div></div></div><div class="false flex flex-col gap-2 h-full"></div></div></div>This hides type and lint problems.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Data model is browser-scoped</strong><ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Every visitor gets their own localStorage copy. Admin changes on one machine never appear for other users. This is why the live site looks empty to most people.</li>
</ul></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">No real backend logic</strong><ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">No API routes, no server actions for critical operations, no email notifications, no actual payment flow.</li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Marketing &amp; legal risk (important)</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The site presents itself as:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">“Official Tesla Ecosystem Marketplace”</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">“Bank-grade Security”, “Real-time Pricing”, “Instant Settlement”</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">“2.4T+ Trading Volume”, “50K+ Active Traders”, “99.9% Uptime”</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">“Book a Private Session with Elon Musk” for <strong class="font-semibold">$50,000</strong></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Investment packages with expected returns</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Giveaways of real Tesla vehicles</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">“Verified” inventory, “institutional-grade feeds”</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">There <strong class="font-semibold">is</strong> a small footer disclaimer, but the overall tone (especially the VIP Elon session and the word “Official”) is extremely aggressive. Combined with payment methods (bank wire, crypto, card) and investment language, this pattern is commonly associated with <strong class="font-semibold">scam / advance-fee / fake marketplace</strong> sites. Even if your intent is pure demo or portfolio, the risk of:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Trademark complaints from Tesla</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">User confusion / fraud reports</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Payment processor or domain issues</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">…is high if this stays public with the current claims.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Honest overall judgment</h3>













































<div class="relative group/table my-2"><div class="relative w-fit max-w-full"><div class="relative rounded-[16px] bg-surface-l1 border border-border-l1 overflow-hidden"><div dir="auto" class="table-container relative clear-both flex flex-row overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar"><table dir="auto" class="table-card-row-dividers [&amp;_td_ul]:my-1 [&amp;_td_ol]:my-1 [&amp;_td_li]:my-0"><thead class="sticky [top:var(--thead-sticky-top)] border-b-0 [&amp;_th]:h-auto bg-surface-l1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary"><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg">Category</th><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="sm">Score (1–10)</th><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg">Comment</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Visual design &amp; Tesla branding</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="sm" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">8.5</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Looks premium and polished</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Feature completeness (as a demo)</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="sm" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">8</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Lots of admin panels and flows</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Code architecture &amp; maintainability</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="sm" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">4.5</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Monolithic, client-only, incomplete hybrid</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Security</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="sm" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">1.5</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Unusable for real users or money</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Production readiness</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="sm" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">2</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">localStorage + no real backend</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Honesty of marketing claims</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="sm" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">2</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Far exceeds what the code delivers</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Educational / portfolio value</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="sm" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">7</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Good showcase of a full admin UI</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="absolute top-full inset-x-0 z-10 overflow-x-auto table-card-scrollbar-hidden"><div class="table-card-scroll-sizer" style="height: 1px; width: 605px;"></div></div></div><div class="print:hidden mt-2 flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/table:opacity-100 group-focus-within/table:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium leading-[normal] cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus-visible:ring-fg-accent transition-colors duration-100 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none text-fg-secondary hover:text-fg-primary hover:bg-button-ghost-hover disabled:hover:text-fg-secondary disabled:hover:bg-transparent [&amp;_svg]:hover:text-fg-primary h-8 w-8 rounded-full" type="button" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><div style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"><div class="[&amp;&gt;svg_*]:stroke-current" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px); content-visibility: visible;"><defs><clippath id="__lottie_element_141"><rect width="24" height="24" x="0" y="0"></rect></clippath><g id="__lottie_element_148"><g style="display: block;" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,9.998000144958496,14)" opacity="1"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path fill="rgb(217,217,217)" fill-opacity="1" d=" M9,-5 C9,-5 9,5 9,5 C9,7.207600116729736 7.207600116729736,9 5,9 C5,9 -5,9 -5,9 C-7.207600116729736,9 -9,7.2076001