aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-row items-center gap-1 text-secondary text-sm leading-6 w-fit pt-3 pb-0 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-0 cursor-pointer group/canvas"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span>Worked for 1m 11s</span></span><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center" style="transform: rotate(-90deg);"><svg width="0.875rem" height="0.875rem" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><g id="name=chevron-down-md"><path id="vector" d="M19.4141 10L12 17.4141L4.58594 10L6 8.58594L12 14.5859L18 8.58594L19.4141 10Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></span></button></div><div aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="relative response-content-markdown markdown chat-md chat-md-links [&amp;&gt;:first-child:not(.not-prose)]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:last-child:not(.not-prose)]:mb-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Technical feature gap analysis</strong> — focused on <strong class="font-semibold">3D-adjacent depth, gradient systems, and visual atmosphere</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">I inspected the live DOM, computed styles, and CSS bundles of
<a href="https://v0-database-table-setup-2-gamma.vercel.app/" node="[object Object]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://v0-database-table-setup-2-gamma.vercel.app/</a>
and compared them directly against your Tesla Trade site (<a href="https://tesla-energy-ebon.vercel.app/" node="[object Object]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://tesla-energy-ebon.vercel.app</a> + the source you provided).</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Your site is a clean, flat, high-contrast dark UI with solid <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">#E82127</span> accents and mostly solid/semi-transparent cards. The reference site is a <strong class="font-semibold">layered, atmospheric, cyber-luxury</strong> treatment of almost the same content. Here are the distinctive technical features it has that you currently lack.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">1. Ambient “volumetric” light orbs (pseudo-3D depth)</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">What they have</strong></p>
<div dir="auto" class="not-prose"><div class="relative not-prose @container/code-block [&amp;_div+div]:!mt-0 mb-3 mt-3 @md:-mx-4 @md:-mr-4" data-testid="code-block"><div class="border border-warm-gray-100 dark:border-neutral-900 rounded-xl"><div class="group/code-header flex flex-row px-4 py-2 h-10 items-center rounded-t-xl sticky top-0 z-10 bg-black [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:pr-1 [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:border-b [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:border-warm-gray-100 dark:[.wd-refresh_&amp;]:bg-surface-inset dark:[.wd-refresh_&amp;]:border-neutral-900"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-secondary select-none">HTML</span><div class="ml-auto flex flex-row gap-0.5 print:hidden [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:gap-0"><div class="flex flex-row gap-0.5 [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:gap-0" style="opacity: 1;"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus-visible:ring-fg-accent transition-colors duration-100 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none text-fg-secondary hover:text-fg-primary disabled:hover:text-fg-secondary hover:bg-surface-l2 disabled:hover:bg-surface-l1 h-8 rounded-xl px-3 text-xs bg-transparent" type="button" aria-label="Wrap" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrap-text size-4"><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="6" y2="6"></line><path d="M3 12h15a3 3 0 1 1 0 6h-4"></path><polyline points="16 16 14 18 16 20"></polyline><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disable