 border-top-width: medium; border-right-color: ; border-right-style: ; border-right-width: ; border-bottom-color: ; border-bottom-style: ; border-bottom-width: ; border-left-color: ; border-left-style: ; border-left-width: ; border-image-source: ; border-image-slice: ; border-image-width: ; border-image-outset: ; border-image-repeat: ; padding: 0px 16px 16px; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 0.9em; font-family: var(--font-ibm-plex-mono); line-height: 1.5em; background-color: hsl(var(--surface-inset)); color: var(--fg-primary); display: block; overflow: auto;"><pre class="shiki slack-dark" tabindex="0" style="background-color: rgb(34, 34, 34); color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"><code><span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&lt;</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">div</span><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);"> class</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);">"absolute w-56 h-56 rounded-full bg-accent/30 blur-3xl"</span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&gt;&lt;/</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">div</span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&lt;</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">div</span><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);"> class</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);">"absolute w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-accent/40 blur-2xl"</span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&gt;&lt;/</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">div</span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&lt;</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">div</span><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);"> class</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);">"fixed top-20 right-20 w-96 h-96 bg-accent/10 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20 animate-pulse -z-10"</span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&gt;&lt;/</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">div</span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&lt;</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">div</span><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);"> class</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);">"fixed bottom-40 left-10 w-72 h-72 bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20 animate-pulse -z-10"</span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&gt;&lt;/</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">div</span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div><div></div></div><div class="false flex flex-col gap-2 h-full"></div></div></div>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Multiple large <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">blur-3xl</span> / <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">blur-2xl</span> circles with low opacity cyan/accent color.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Positioned at different depths (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">fixed</span> + <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">-z-10</span>) so content floats above them.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Soft pulse animation → creates a living, volumetric glow field.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">What you have</strong>
Almost none. Your backgrounds are solid black (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">bg-black</span> / <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">#121214</span>) with no ambient light sources.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Why it feels 3D</strong>
Large Gaussian blurs + overlapping translucent layers simulate light scattering in space — the classic “depth without real 3D” technique.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">2. Multi-stop gradient language (cyan cyber palette)</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">What they have</strong></p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Accent is cyan (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">#00d9ff</span> range), not Tesla red.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Heavy use of multi-stop gradients:<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">bg-gradient-to-r from-accent via-cyan-400 to-accent</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">bg-gradient-to-r from-background/95 via-background/85 to-background/70</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-black/40</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Gradient text: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">bg-gradient-to-r from-accent via-cyan-400 to-accent bg-clip-text text-transparent</span></li>
</ul></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Horizontal hairline accents: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent to-transparent</span></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">What you have</strong>
Mostly solid colors + occasional simple borders. Very little <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">from-</span> / <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">via-</span> / <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">to-</span> chaining and almost no gradient text.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">3. Glassmorphism system (true frosted glass)</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">What they have</strong></p>
