er disabled:hover:text-fg-secondary disabled:hover:bg-transparent [&amp;_svg]:hover:text-fg-primary h-8 w-8 rounded-full" type="button" aria-label="Save table" data-state="closed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="stroke-[2] size-4"><path d="M4.16667 13.3333C4.16667 13.9304 4.16693 14.3282 4.1919 14.6338C4.21604 14.9293 4.25893 15.0648 4.30257 15.1506C4.42242 15.3858 4.61425 15.5776 4.84945 15.6974C4.93524 15.7411 5.07075 15.784 5.36621 15.8081C5.6718 15.8331 6.06956 15.8333 6.66667 15.8333H13.3333C13.9304 15.8333 14.3282 15.8331 14.6338 15.8081C14.9293 15.784 15.0648 15.7411 15.1506 15.6974C15.3858 15.5776 15.5776 15.3858 15.6974 15.1506C15.7411 15.0648 15.784 14.9293 15.8081 14.6338C15.8331 14.3282 15.8333 13.9304 15.8333 13.3333V11.6667H17.5V13.3333C17.5 13.903 17.5009 14.3805 17.4691 14.7697C17.4365 15.1686 17.3652 15.5476 17.1818 15.9074C16.9022 16.4562 16.4562 16.9022 15.9074 17.1818C15.5476 17.3651 15.1686 17.4365 14.7697 17.4691C14.3805 17.5009 13.903 17.5 13.3333 17.5H6.66667C6.09703 17.5 5.61951 17.5009 5.23031 17.4691C4.83143 17.4365 4.45245 17.3651 4.09261 17.1818C3.54385 16.9022 3.09782 16.4562 2.8182 15.9074C2.63485 15.5476 2.56353 15.1686 2.53093 14.7697C2.49913 14.3805 2.5 13.903 2.5 13.3333V11.6667H4.16667V13.3333Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M10.8333 10.2799L13.5775 7.53581L14.7559 8.71419L10 13.4701L5.24414 8.71419L6.42253 7.53581L9.16667 10.2799V2.5H10.8333V10.2799Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">They are <strong class="font-semibold">not</strong> using real WebGL / Three.js / CSS <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">perspective</span> + <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">rotateX</span>. Everything is achieved with:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">layered absolute/fixed elements</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">heavy <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">blur-*</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">multi-stop linear gradients</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">low-opacity whites and accent colors</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">CSS transforms + keyframe floats</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">That combination is what creates the “3D / premium / depth” feeling.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Practical takeaway for your site</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">If you want to close the visual gap while keeping your Tesla-red identity, the highest-impact additions (in order) are:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Ambient blur orbs (2–4 large fixed circles with red/cyan low opacity + <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">blur-3xl</span> + <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">animate-pulse</span>).</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Real glass cards (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">backdrop-blur-xl</span> + <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">bg-white/5</span> + subtle border).</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Multi-stop gradients on headers, buttons, and section backgrounds.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">A fixed cinematic background image with a dark gradient veil.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Staggered entrance animations and one or two particle floats.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Optional cyan secondary accent for glows/lines so it doesn’t stay pure flat red.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">I can give you exact Tailwind class recipes or component snippets for any of these if you want to implement them next.</p></div></div><section class="inline-media-container flex flex-col gap-1 clear-both"></section><div class="flex gap-2 mt-2 -ms-2 print:hidden"><div class="inline-flex flex-row gap-1 items-center w-fit py-1 ps-1 pe-2 rounded-full cursor-pointer bg-surface-l1 border border-border-l1 hover:bg-surface-l1-hover" role="button" aria-label="10 sources" data-state="closed"><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 3;"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(1)"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 2; margin-inline-start: -12px; mask: radial-gradient(12px at -3px 50%, transparent 99%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(2)"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 1; margin-inline-start: -12px; mask: radial-gradient(12px at -3px 50%, transparent 99%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(1)"></div><div class="truncate text-sm">10 sources</div></div></div></div><div class="order-first sticky hidden @md/mainview:block top-11 h-0 opacity-0 group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-100 -ml-[36px] @lg/mainview:-ml-[40px] -left-[26px]"><div class="min-h-7 py-4 flex flex-col gap-0.5"></div></div><div class="action-buttons h-8 mt-0.5 mb-2 flex flex-row flex-wrap w-full