la Trade site. They keep your red identity (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">#E82127</span>) while adding the depth, glass, and atmospheric techniques from the reference.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">1. Ambient volumetric light orbs (pseudo-3D depth)</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Place these <strong class="font-semibold">once</strong> near the top of your main layout or homepage (inside a relative/full-height container):</p>
