<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Step 8 — Quick test checklist</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">After the changes:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">npm run dev</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Open <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">http://localhost:3000</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Check:<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Soft red glowing orbs behind the content</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Header becomes frosted glass when you scroll</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Cards look translucent / glassy</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Buttons have a shine sweep on hover</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Hero title has a white-to-red gradient</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Tiny particles slowly float</li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">If the orbs feel too strong, lower opacity (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">/15</span> → <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">/10</span>) or remove the cyan one.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Recommended order of application (safest)</h3>





















































<div class="relative group/table my-2"><div class="relative w-fit max-w-full"><div class="relative rounded-[16px] bg-surface-l1 border border-border-l1 overflow-hidden"><div dir="auto" class="table-container relative clear-both flex flex-row overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar"><table dir="auto" class="table-card-row-dividers [&amp;_td_ul]:my-1 [&amp;_td_ol]:my-1 [&amp;_td_li]:my-0"><thead class="sticky [top:var(--thead-sticky-top)] border-b-0 [&amp;_th]:h-auto bg-surface-l1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary"><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="xs">Order</th><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="xl">Change</th><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md">Risk</th><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg">Visual impact</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="xs" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">1</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="xl" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">globals.css keyframes</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">None</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">—</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="xs" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">2</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="xl" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Ambient orbs + particles</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md