<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Leave the rest of your page content as it is for now. Just make sure the final closing <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">&lt;/div&gt;</span> of the component is still there.</p>
<h4 dir="auto" class="font-semibold max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-4 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0.2px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">B. Glass header</h4>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Still in <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">src/app/page.tsx</span>, find your <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">&lt;header&gt;</span> tag and replace its <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">className</span> with:</p>
