<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">5. Open the site</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">In your browser go to: <strong class="font-semibold"><a href="http://localhost:3000/" node="[object Object]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">http://localhost:3000</a></strong></p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">About the CSS</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">From the screenshot, the float keyframes <strong class="font-semibold">are already</strong> in <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">src/app/globals.css</span> — that part looks correct. You do <strong class="font-semibold">not</strong> need to add them again.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Just make sure:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><button class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono cursor-pointer bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300" type="button">page.tsx</button> is the upgraded version I gave you</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><button class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono cursor-pointer bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300" type="button">globals.css</button> has the <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">@keyframes float</span> block at the bottom</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">If <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">npm install</span> fails</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Tell me the exact error message and I’ll fix it. Common ones:</p>





















<div class="relative group/table my-2"><div class="relative w-fit max-w-full"><div class="relative rounded-[16px] bg-surface-l1 border border-border-l1 overflow-hidden"><div dir="auto" class="table-container relative clear-both flex flex-row overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar"><table dir="auto" class="table-card-row-dividers [&amp;_td_ul]:my-1 [&amp;_td_ol]:my-1 [&amp;_td_li]:my-0"><thead class="sticky [top:var(--thead-sticky-top)] border-b-0 [&amp;_th]:h-auto bg-surface-l1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary"><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md">Error</th><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="xl">Fix</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">npm is not recognized</span></td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="xl" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Install Node.js from <a href="https://nodejs.org/" node="[object Object]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://nodejs.org</a> (LTS version), then restart VS Code</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Permission / EACCES</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="xl" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Run the terminal as Administrator or use <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">npm install --legacy-peer-deps</span></td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="brea