ng-container mb-1"><div class="not-prose flex flex-col"><div class="relative mb-2 text-sm"><button type="button" data-testid="canvas-trigger" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-row items-center gap-1 text-secondary text-sm leading-6 w-fit pt-3 pb-0 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-0 cursor-pointer group/canvas"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span>Worked for 6s</span></span><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center" style="transform: rotate(-90deg);"><svg width="0.875rem" height="0.875rem" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><g id="name=chevron-down-md"><path id="vector" d="M19.4141 10L12 17.4141L4.58594 10L6 8.58594L12 14.5859L18 8.58594L19.4141 10Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></span></button></div><div aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="relative response-content-markdown markdown chat-md chat-md-links [&amp;&gt;:first-child:not(.not-prose)]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:last-child:not(.not-prose)]:mb-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The error is still the same: <strong class="font-semibold">Next.js is not installed</strong> in that folder.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">You are running <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">npm run dev</span> <strong class="font-semibold">before</strong> dependencies are installed. That is why Windows says <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">'next' is not recognized</span>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Do this exactly</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">1. In the VS Code terminal, first run:</strong></p>
