<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Press Enter and <strong class="font-semibold">wait</strong>.
It must finish completely. You will see many lines of packages downloading. At the end it should return to the prompt without a red error.</p>
