).</p>
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Solution</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Use <strong class="font-semibold">unique lightweight remote image URLs</strong> (Unsplash / Pexels, already compressed) for every product — vehicles, energy, and robotics.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">I’ve prepared the full replacement seed for you:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Guide + full code:</strong><div class="my-4 flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-3xl border border-border-l1 cursor-pointer select-none group hover:bg-surface-l1 [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:rounded-xl not-prose" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Open STORE_INVENTORY_PATCH.md"><img alt="" class="h-16 w-auto shrink-0 rounded-lg object-contain drop-shadow-sm" src="./model-3-performance_files/default_dark.png"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><span class="truncate text-sm font-medium text-fg-primary">STORE_INVENTORY_PATCH.md</span><span class="text-xs font-normal text-fg-secondary">Document · 12.45 KB</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus-visible:ring-fg-accent transition-colors duration-100 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none border border-border-l2 text-fg-primary hover:bg-button-ghost-hover [&amp;_svg]:hover:text-fg-primary disabled:hover:bg-transparent h-8 px-3 text-xs rounded-full shrink-0" type="button" aria-label="Download STORE_INVENTORY_PATCH.md"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="stroke-[2] size-4"><path d="M4.16667 13.3333C4.16667 13.9304 4.16693 14.3282 4.1919 14.6338C4.21604 14.9293 4.25893 15.0648 4.30257 15.1506C4.42242 15.3858 4.61425 15.5776 4.84945 15.6974C4.93524 15.7411 5.07075 15.784 5.36621 15.8081C5.6718 15.8331 6.06956 15.8333 6.66667 15.8333H13.3333C13.9304 15.8333 14.3282 15.8331 14.6338 15.8081C14.9293 15.784 15.0648 15.7411 15.1506 15.6974C15.3858 15.5776 15.5776 15.3858 15.6974 15.1506C15.7411 15.0648 15.784 14.9293 15.8081 14.6