em</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">[] </span><span style="color: rgb(212, 212, 212);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> [</span></span></code></pre></div><div></div></div><div class="false flex flex-col gap-2 h-full"></div></div></div></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Delete the old array contents</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Paste the new array from the guide file (all vehicles + energy + robotics with unique URLs)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">2. Force the new data to load</strong>
Old inventory is stuck in the browser. Either:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Open <strong class="font-semibold"><a href="http://localhost:3000/admin" node="[object Object]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">http://localhost:3000/admin</a></strong> → reset data if available
<strong class="font-semibold">or</strong></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Press <strong class="font-semibold">F12</strong> → <strong class="font-semibold">Application</strong> → <strong class="font-semibold">Local Storage</strong> → delete <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">tesla_admin_inventory</span> → refresh the page</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">3. Refresh</strong> <a href="http://localhost:3000/" node="[object Object]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">http://localhost:3000</a> and check Inventory filters (Vehicles / Energy / Robotics)</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">What’s included</h3>

























