<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Honest answer about the link</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">I can generate the image (above), but <strong class="font-semibold">Grok-generated images are not permanent public URLs</strong> you can paste into <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">store.ts</span> for production. They appear in this chat; they are not hosted on a CDN for your site.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">How to get a real embeddable link (do this)</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Best option for your project — put it in <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">/public</span>:</strong></p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Right-click the generated image above → <strong class="font-semibold">Save image as…</strong>
Save as: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">cybertruck-foundation.jpg</span></li>
