<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">For the rest of the inventory</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Same process for each unique model:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">I generate the accurate image</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">You save it into <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">public/products/</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">You reference <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">/products/model-name.jpg</span> in the seed</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">That avoids repeated stock photos and keeps images light (export JPG at ~80% quality, max width 1200px).</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Want me to generate the next unique vehicle the same way (e.g. <strong class="font-semibold">Model S Plaid</strong>, <strong class="font-semibold">Model 3 Performance</strong>, <strong class="font-semibold">Model X Plaid</strong>)? Say which one and I’ll do it.</p></div></div><section class="inline-media-container flex flex-col gap-1 clear-both"></section><div class="flex gap-2 mt-2 -ms-2 print:hidden"><div class="inline-flex flex-row gap-1 items-center w-fit py-1 ps-1 pe-2 rounded-full cursor-pointer bg-surface-l1 border border-border-l1 hover:bg-surface-l1-hover" role="button" aria-label="5 sources" data-state="closed"><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 3;"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(3)"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 2; margin-inline-start: -12px; mask: radial-gradient(12px at -3px 50%, transparent 99%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(4)"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 1; margin-inline-start: -12px; mask: radial-gradient(12px at -3px 50%, transparent 99%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(5)"></div><div class="truncate text-sm">5 sources</div></div></div></div><div class="order-first sticky hidden @md/mainview:block top-11 h-0 opacity-0 group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-100 -ml-[36px] @lg/mainview:-ml-[40px] -left-