<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Unsplash only hosts photos <strong class="font-semibold">they</strong> publish. Generated images from this chat are not uploaded there, and no tool I have can create a real Unsplash URL.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">What that URL format actually is</h3>
