p-style: none; border-top-width: medium; border-right-color: ; border-right-style: ; border-right-width: ; border-bottom-color: ; border-bottom-style: ; border-bottom-width: ; border-left-color: ; border-left-style: ; border-left-width: ; border-image-source: ; border-image-slice: ; border-image-width: ; border-image-outset: ; border-image-repeat: ; padding: 0px 16px 16px; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 0.9em; font-family: var(--font-ibm-plex-mono); line-height: 1.5em; background-color: hsl(var(--surface-inset)); color: var(--fg-primary); display: block; overflow: auto;"><pre class="shiki slack-dark" tabindex="0" style="background-color: rgb(34, 34, 34); color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"><code><span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">image: </span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);">"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1682687220742-aba13b6e50ba?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=70"</span></span></code></pre></div><div></div></div><div class="false flex flex-col gap-2 h-full"></div></div></div>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">That is:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">a file already on Unsplash’s servers</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">with resize (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">w=800</span>) and quality (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">q=70</span>) query params</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">I cannot create a new photo ID on their CDN.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">What you can do instead (same idea, works in your code)</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Option A — Local (best for your Next.js app)</strong></p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Right‑click the Cybertruck image I generated → <strong class="font-semibold">Save image as</strong>
e.g. <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">cybertruck-foundation.jpg</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Optional: compress at <a href="https://tinypng.com/" node="[object Object]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">tinypng.com</a> or <a href="https://squoosh.app/" node="[object Object]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">squoosh.app</a> (target ~100–200 KB)</li>
