24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><g id="name=chevron-down-md"><path id="vector" d="M19.4141 10L12 17.4141L4.58594 10L6 8.58594L12 14.5859L18 8.58594L19.4141 10Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></span></button></div><div aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="relative response-content-markdown markdown chat-md chat-md-links [&amp;&gt;:first-child:not(.not-prose)]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:last-child:not(.not-prose)]:mb-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Honestly: <strong class="font-semibold">visually, almost none.</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Both images show the same Cybertruck body language:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Stainless steel angular exoskeleton</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Full-width LED light bar</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Black wheel arches</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Geometric cab and bed</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Studio dark background</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">That’s accurate to real life. Tesla did <strong class="font-semibold">not</strong> give the Cyberbeast a different exterior shape. The Foundation Series and Cyberbeast share the same body.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Real differences (specs, not looks)</h3>



































<div class="relative group/table my-2"><div class="relative w-fit max-w-full"><div class="relative rounded-[16px] bg-surface-l1 border border-border-l1 overflow-hidden"><div dir="auto" class="table-container relative clear-both flex flex-row overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar"><table dir="auto" class="table-card-row-dividers [&amp;_td_ul]:my-1 [&amp;_td_ol]:my-1 [&amp;_td_li]:my-0"><thead class="sticky [top:var(--thead-sticky-top)] border-b-0 [&amp;_th]:h-auto bg-surface-l1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary"><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md"></th><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg"><strong class="font-semibold">Foundation Series</strong></th><th class="break-words text-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg"><strong class="font-semibold">Cyberbeast</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Motors</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Dual / standard AWD setup in many configs</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Tri-motor</strong> performance</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">0–60</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">~4.1s (AWD) class</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">~2.6s</strong></td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Power</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Lower</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Higher (Beast-tuned)</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Positioning</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Launch / early allocation trim</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Top performance trim</td></tr><tr class="[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base"><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="md" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Exterior</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Same stainless body</td><td class="break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug" data-col-size="lg" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Same stainless body</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="absolute top-full inset-x-0 z-10 overflow-x-auto table-card-scrollbar-hidden"><div class="table-card-scroll-sizer" style="height: 1px; width: 530px;"></div></div></div><div class="print:hidden mt-2 flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/table:opacity-100 group-focus-within/table:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium leading-[normal] cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:outline-none [.wd-refresh_