accent transition-colors duration-100 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none text-fg-secondary hover:text-fg-primary hover:bg-button-ghost-hover disabled:hover:text-fg-secondary disabled:hover:bg-transparent [&amp;_svg]:hover:text-fg-primary h-8 w-8 rounded-full" type="button" aria-label="Save table" data-state="closed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="stroke-[2] size-4"><path d="M4.16667 13.3333C4.16667 13.9304 4.16693 14.3282 4.1919 14.6338C4.21604 14.9293 4.25893 15.0648 4.30257 15.1506C4.42242 15.3858 4.61425 15.5776 4.84945 15.6974C4.93524 15.7411 5.07075 15.784 5.36621 15.8081C5.6718 15.8331 6.06956 15.8333 6.66667 15.8333H13.3333C13.9304 15.8333 14.3282 15.8331 14.6338 15.8081C14.9293 15.784 15.0648 15.7411 15.1506 15.6974C15.3858 15.5776 15.5776 15.3858 15.6974 15.1506C15.7411 15.0648 15.784 14.9293 15.8081 14.6338C15.8331 14.3282 15.8333 13.9304 15.8333 13.3333V11.6667H17.5V13.3333C17.5 13.903 17.5009 14.3805 17.4691 14.7697C17.4365 15.1686 17.3652 15.5476 17.1818 15.9074C16.9022 16.4562 16.4562 16.9022 15.9074 17.1818C15.5476 17.3651 15.1686 17.4365 14.7697 17.4691C14.3805 17.5009 13.903 17.5 13.3333 17.5H6.66667C6.09703 17.5 5.61951 17.5009 5.23031 17.4691C4.83143 17.4365 4.45245 17.3651 4.09261 17.1818C3.54385 16.9022 3.09782 16.4562 2.8182 15.9074C2.63485 15.5476 2.56353 15.1686 2.53093 14.7697C2.49913 14.3805 2.5 13.903 2.5 13.3333V11.6667H4.16667V13.3333Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M10.8333 10.2799L13.5775 7.53581L14.7559 8.71419L10 13.4701L5.24414 8.71419L6.42253 7.53581L9.16667 10.2799V2.5H10.8333V10.2799Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">So the cars look nearly identical in photos. The “Beast” is about powertrain and performance, not a different shell.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">If you want them to look more distinct on the site</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">You can differentiate with:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Slightly different angle</strong> (Beast more aggressive front 3/4, Foundation more side profile)</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Wheel style</strong> (Beast with darker/sportier wheels — already hinted in the second image)</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Badge / label on the card</strong> (“CYBERBEAST” vs “FOUNDATION”)</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Color grading</strong> (Beast cooler/steel, Foundation warmer studio light)</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">I can regenerate the Cyberbeast with a more aggressive angle, darker wheels, and a lower stance so it reads as the performance version next to the Foundation one. Want that?</p></div></div><section class="inline-media-container flex flex-col gap-1 clear-both"></section><div class="flex gap-2 mt-2 -ms-2 print:hidden"></div></div><div class="order-first sticky hidden @md/mainview:block top-11 h-0 opacity-0 group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-100 -ml-[36px] @lg/mainview:-ml-[40px] -left-[26px]"><div class="min-h-7 py-4 flex flex-col gap-0.5"></div></div><div class="action-buttons h-8 mt-0.5 mb-2 flex flex-row flex-wrap w-full justify-between print:hidden"><div class="flex items-center gap-[2px] w-max rounded-lg text-xs px-2 start-0 @md/chat:start-3 -ml-4" style="bottom: 0px;"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium leading-[normal] cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus:outline-none [.wd-refresh_&amp;]:focus-visible:ring-fg-accent transition-colors duration-100 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none text-fg-secondary hover:text-fg-primary hover:bg-button-ghost-hover disabled:hover:text-fg-secondary disabled:hover:bg-transparent [&amp;_svg]:hover:text-fg-primary h-8 w-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-100 [.last-response_&amp;]:opacity-100 disabled:opacity-0 group-focus-within:disabled:opacity-60 group-hover:disabled:opacity-60 [.last-response_&amp;]:disabled:opacity-60" type="button" aria-label="Copy response" data-state="closed"><div style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"><div class="[&amp;&gt;svg_*]:stroke-current" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http: