<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">After pasting (required once)</h3>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Save <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">store.ts</span></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">F12 → <strong class="font-semibold">Application</strong> → <strong class="font-semibold">Local Storage</strong> → delete <strong class="font-semibold"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">tesla_admin_inventory</span></strong></li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class="font-semibold">Ctrl + Shift + R</strong></li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Every listing then uses a <strong class="font-semibold">different</strong> compressed remote URL (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">w=800</span> / <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">q=70</span> or Pexels compress). No local repeats.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Note:</strong> These are stock EV / solar / robot photos (not official Tesla media). For production, swap any URL later in Admin → Inventory.</p></div></div><section class="inline-media-container flex flex-col gap-1 clear-both"></section><div class="flex gap-2 mt-2 -ms-2 print:hidden"><div class="inline-flex flex-row gap-1 items-center w-fit py-1 ps-1 pe-2 rounded-full cursor-pointer bg-surface-l1 border border-border-l1 hover:bg-surface-l1-hover" role="button" aria-label="20 sources" data-state="closed"><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 3;"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(6)"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 2; margin-inline-start: -12px; mask: radial-gradient(12px at -3px 50%, transparent 99%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(9)"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 1; margin-inline-start: -12px; mask: radial-gradient(12px at -3px 50%, transparent 99%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(4)"></div><div class="truncate text-sm">20 sources</div></div></div></div><div class="order-first sticky hidden @md/mainview:block top-11 h-0 opacity-0 group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-100 -ml-[36px] @lg/mainview:-ml-[40px] -left-[26px]"><div class="min-h-7 py-4 flex flex-col gap-0.5"></div></div><div class="action-b