<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The <strong class="font-semibold">accurate</strong> images we already generated in this chat (Foundation silver, Cyberbeast black, Model S Plaid black, Model S Long Range white, Model 3 Performance red) are the ones that actually look like the models.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Correct way (one batch, no more bad URLs)</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">1. Save the generated images</strong> (right‑click each → Save as):</p>





























