<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    description:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "Tri-motor AWD, 1,020 hp, 359 mile range. 0-60 in 1.99s. Low mileage, pristine condition."</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    image:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "/products/model-s-plaid.jpg"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    createdAt:</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);"> now</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">(),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">  },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">  {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    id:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "inv-4"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    title:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "2025 Model S Long Range"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    category:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "Vehicles"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    price:</span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);"> 79990</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    status:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "available"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    description:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "Dual motor AWD. Up to 405 miles range. Premium interior. Full Self-Driving ready."</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    image:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "/products/model-s-long-range.jpg"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    createdAt:</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);"> now</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">(),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">  },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">  {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    id:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "inv-5"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    title:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "2025 Model 3 Performance"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    category:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "Vehicles"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    price:</span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);"> 54990</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    status:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "available"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    description:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "Highland Performance. Adaptive dampers, track mode, carbon spoiler. 0-60 in 2.9s."</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    image:</span><span style="color: rgb(206, 145, 120);"> "/products/model-3-performance.jpg"</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">    createdAt:</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);"> now</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">(),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">  },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(106, 153, 85);">  // ... keep the rest of your inventory with existing local files for now</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">];</span></span></code></pre></div><div></div></div><div class="false flex flex-col gap-2 h-full"></div></div></div>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">3.</strong> Delete <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">tesla_admin_inventory</span> in Local Storage → hard refresh.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3">Bottom line</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">I will <strong class="font-semibold">not</strong> give more unverified Unsplash links for specific Tesla trims.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Next steps that actually work:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">You save the 5 generated images into <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">public/products/</span> with the names above</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">I generate the remaining models (Model 3 LR, Model X, Model Y, Energy, Robotics) the same way</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">One final seed with unique <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">/products/...</span> paths for everything</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Say <strong class="font-semibold">“continue generating the rest”</strong> and I’ll produce the next batch of accurate images so we finish the inventory properly.</p></div></div><section class="inline-media-container flex flex-col gap-1 clear-both"></section><div class="flex gap-2 mt-2 -ms-2 print:hidden"><div class="inline-flex flex-row gap-1 items-center w-fit py-1 ps-1 pe-2 rounded-full cursor-pointer bg-surface-l1 border border-border-l1 hover:bg-surface-l1-hover" role="button" aria-label="20 sources" data-state="closed"><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 3;"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(10)"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 2; margin-inline-start: -12px; mask: radial-gradient(12px at -3px 50%, transparent 99%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(10)"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface border border-border-l1 size-5" style="z-index: 1; margin-inline-start: -12px; mask: radial-gradient(12px at -3px 50%, transparent 99%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);"><img class="size-4 shrink-0 m-0 rounded-full" alt="" role="presentation" src="./model-3-performance_files/favicons(10)"></div><div class="truncate text-sm">20 sources</div></div></div></div><div class="order-first sticky hidden @md/mainview:block top-11 h-0 opacity-0 group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-100 -ml-[36px] @lg/mainview:-ml-[40px] -left-[26px]"><div class="min-h-7 py-4 flex flex-col gap-0.5"></div></div><div class="action-buttons 